<title>CANADA: GEC-Alsthom gets C$27 mln Hydro-Quebec contract.</title>
<headline>GEC-Alsthom gets C$27 mln Hydro-Quebec contract.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>GEC-Alsthom NV's GEC-Alsthom Energies unit said on Monday that it was awarded a C$27 million contract for the modernization and rehabilitation of Hydro-Quebec's Bersimis 1 power station in Forestville, Quebec.</p>
<p>Four of eight turbine-generator units will be modernized and upgraded. The work includes the rehabilitation of the generators, the modernization of auxiliary systems and the installation of new monitoring systems.</p>
<p>The work will begin in 1997 for completion in 2001.</p>
<p>((Reuters Montreal bureau 514-985-2434))</p>
